# W30b, host a (k10): hosts Dry Land and waits at stag0201's gate arrival until b's first arrival at dng205b2 is over,
# then goes on to dng205b2 through dng205b1. The ways on are the depart action with the exits' own targets (stag0202's
# matz01: dng205b1 point 0; dng205b1's matz02: dng205b2 point 0), a alone in its stage group. (No stay in the Dry Land
# dungeons before b's second arrival: a k10 character fighting in dng205b1 died within 60 s in rounds r2b and r2c.)
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@80
explore mate00 until onme:mate00
gate mate00 1 until stage=stag0201,control
log a hosts Dry Land
idle until epoch>=@180
depart dng205b1 0 until stage=dng205b1,control
log a in dng205b1
depart dng205b2 0 until stage=dng205b2,control
log a in dng205b2
idle until present=2,sealed>=600 or epoch>=@500
log b joined a in B2
